## backend/cycle_anchor.py
- **TENTATIVE_CYCLE_TOP** = date(2025, 10, 6) (BTC ATH ~$126,200) — einzige Definition des Cycle-Top-Datums. main.py und analyzer.py importieren TENTATIVE_CYCLE_TOP und compute_days_since_top von cycle_anchor. API liefert cycle_top_date (isoformat) und cycle_top_confirmed: False. Kein hardcodiertes Datum oder "Oct 2025" woanders.
- **Phase-aware**: compute_cycle_anchor() wenn today >= TENTATIVE_CYCLE_TOP: current_phase=BEAR, cycle_position_percent aus bear_progress (days_since_top / HISTORICAL_AVERAGE_BEAR_DAYS); sonst BULL aus bull_progress. Return-Dict enthaelt: current_phase, phase_label, phase_description, bear_progress_percent (0.0 in BULL).

## backend/services/backtest_engine.py
- Kraken OHLC **weekly** (interval=10080) — Daily max 720 Tage API-Grenze; 720 Wochen = ~13.8 Jahre. WINDOW_200W=**200** (200 wöchentliche Datenpunkte = 200-Wochen MA). since=**1381363200** (2013-10-10). Cache min 400 Eintraege. _fetch_since ebenfalls interval 10080.
- _fetch_btc_history: Bei data.get("error") oder "result" not in data: logger.warning. Abbruchbedingung len(candles) < 10.
- _load_or_build_cache: Bei Exception logger.warning("backtest cache load failed: %s", e), nicht pass.
- Backtest nutzt /tmp/backtest_cache.json. ARC (einheitlich mit Live): ma_200w*0.35 + drawdown*0.25 + macro_liq*0.25 + fg_to_score(fear_greed)*0.15. fg_to_score aus scoring importieren. **Kein rescale_arc** — arc = max(0, min(100, arc)). /api/backtest liefert raw ARC. macro_liq aus FRED Net Liquidity; F&G: _fetch_fg_history; Return: [{"date", "price", "score"}, ...]. **5 Zonen**: ZONES = [(0,30),(30,40),(40,60),(60,70),(70,100)], ZONE_NAMES = ["Deep Value", "Accumulation", "Expansion", "Risk Rising", "Euphoria"] (Fix 56).
- **Expected Range (raw ARC)**: main.py _get_expected_range() feste Lookup fuer raw ARC (Banden <25, <35, <45, <55, <65, >=65); avg_12m hard cap 300%.
- **Expected Range zone-specific**: historical_returns.compute_high_risk_drawdown(backtest_data) for **Euphoria zone** with zone-crossing entry (prev < 70, curr >= 70); max drawdown from peak after entry, 52w window. main.py _get_expected_range(arc, fwd, high_risk_drawdown): arc < 50 forward_return; 50-65 type "reduce", label "REDUCE — DO NOT BUY"; arc >= 65 type "drawdown" mit avg_drawdown/max_drawdown/min_drawdown. index.html: expected_range nach type — forward_return gruen +%; reduce "REDUCE — DO NOT BUY" #f97316; drawdown "AVG -X% FROM PEAK" #ef4444, darunter "Worst case: -Y%".
- **Historical Returns (5 Zonen)**: compute_historical_returns() 5 Zonen (deep_value, accumulation, expansion, risk_rising, euphoria); Entry nur bei Zone-Crossing. compute_high_risk_drawdown() Euphoria-Eintritt bei prev < 70, curr >= 70. Pro Zone: zone_name, entry_count, avg_12m, win_rate_12m (Fix 55). /api/historical-returns Keys risk_rising, euphoria (display_mode reduce/drawdown) (Fix 56).
- **Cycle Overview**: index.html updateShortTermContext() darf bei S.shortTerm.signal nicht mehr komplett per Early-Return abbrechen. _setCyclePhaseTag() immer aufrufen (mit Fallback wenn !ctx), damit Cycle Overview (ca-cycle-phase-tag, cp-st-score, cp-tactical, cp-upside, cp-downside) befuellt wird. Short Term Card (st-score-val, st-tactical etc.) nur befuellen wenn kein S.shortTerm.signal; sonst bleibt renderShortTerm() verantwortlich.
- **Historical Returns Cache**: main.py nach CACHE.update() in refresh_cache() Backtest im separaten try/except ausfuehren und backtest_results, hist_returns, fwd_returns, high_risk_drawdown in CACHE legen. /api/backtest, /api/historical-returns, /api/arc-forward-returns aus CACHE lesen falls vorhanden; get_arc_summary und Snapshot nutzen CACHE fuer results/fwd/dd_data. Backtest-Block darf Haupt-Cache-Refresh nicht crashen.
- **ARC v3**: scoring.py fg_to_score() nicht-linear (Extrema verstaerkt); drawdown_score() bei dd>=0 return 90.0; compute_arc_score() Extreme-Condition-Boosts (ma+fg Top/Bottom) vor clamp. Gewichte unveraendert. main.py lifespan loescht /tmp/backtest_cache.json beim Start damit Backtest mit neuer Logik neu baut.
- **Phase from cycle_anchor only (no ARC)**: analyzer.py get_short_term_context() phase is derived ONLY from cycle_anchor (days_since_top, days_since_bottom, drawdown_from_top). ARC is risk thermometer (Buy/Hold/Sell), NOT phase indicator. Priority order: (1) days_since_top<60 Late Bull, (2) days_since_top<180 and drawdown>−20% Early Bear, (3) days_since_top<365 and drawdown>−40% Mid Bear, (4) days_since_top<365 and drawdown>−55% Late Bear, (5) days_since_top<365 and drawdown<=−55% Deep Bear, (6) days_since_top>=365 and arc>35 Accumulation, (7) days_since_top>=365 and arc<=35 Deep Accumulation, (8) days_since_bottom<180 Early Bull, (9) days_since_bottom<400 Mid Bull, (10) else Late Bull. phase_desc and tactical_signal/tactical_color per phase. main.py /api/historical-returns: elevated reduce, extreme drawdown. index.html: Elevated REDUCE/DO NOT BUY, Extreme drawdown.
- **BTC Chart High-Low Range**: backtest_engine Kraken OHLC: cache and results include high (c[2]), low (c[3]), price (close, c[4]). ARC calculation uses close only. index.html ARC History Chart: BTC Close line (thin yellow), BTC High-Low band (fill to BTC Low, rgba(234,179,8,0.15)), BTC Low line transparent; cycle markers TOP/BOTTOM use result.high and result.low. No change to ARC formula or scoring.

